The Black Scarabese Titans, along with [[Gold Scarabese]], were used by Rassimov to spy on [[Dante Vale]] and his team. Later, his four Black Scarabese Titans joined with the Gold Scarabese to form [[Anubian]]. {{Source|Coming of Age}}

Rassimov summoned the Scarabese Titans to summon Anubian. However, [[Cherit]] was able to delay them by preventing the Gold Scarabese from reaching the others. When Rassimov hit Cherit with a [[Raypulse]], the Scarabese joined, and Anubian was invoked. When [[Baselaird]] defeated Anubian, the Scarabese crawled back to Rassimov. {{Source|Coming of Age}}

In the dreamworld created by [[Arc]], the Legendary Titan of Fate, [[Sophie Casterwill]] encountered [[Spiral Demon]], a hybrid of the [[Marauder]] Titan and lower body of the Black Scarabese. {{source|The Legendary Titan of Fate}}

The Black Scarabese were unbonded from Rassimov by Dante's [[Sorrowbond]] power and recovered by the [[Huntik Foundation]]. Dante told [[Lady S.]] and the other [[Huntik Foundation]] operatives that the Scarabese has to kept separate from each other. {{Source|Rassimov's Secret}}
